id: SCA-016
title: Cargo.toml build script declaration
category: supply-chain
severity: info
engine: pattern
target:
  filenames: Cargo.toml
  exclude_paths: test/ node_modules/ .git/ vendor/
patterns:
  - regex: build\s*=\s*"build\.rs"
    message: Cargo build scripts execute arbitrary code during compilation. The arrayref/onering Rust attacks used build.rs to exfiltrate source code.
fix: Audit every build.rs file for network calls, encoded payloads, or file access outside the build directory. Pin build dependencies to exact versions.
